          <text x="315" y="192" fill="var(--paper-muted)" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">context length →</text>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>Sentences are probabilistic; the probability decays with context length. Hooks don't.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

